From 889e44f4922513bf0cdaeb4e2dad2a2fe864ff80 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: coldshalamov <93robingattis@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 00:18:03 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] perf(render): share unchanged flight-template materials
 across ship copies
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Clone only per-ship mutables (plume opacity, nav/sensor emissive, shield
uniforms, drive-glow). Hull/armor/canopy/secondary keep the template
material identity so later copies skip Material.clone / cloneUniforms and
reuse the warm program. Portable census ~1.96× fewer unique materials
(48 copies); mutable isolation preserved. No dummy prewarm; picture
contract unchanged.
---
